<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367686/eurocert/F8.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="GLOBALGAP"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Supply Chain Traceability from Farm to Consumer</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">GLOBALGAP<!-- --> <span class="text-eurogold-400">Chain of Custody</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">GLOBALGAP Chain of Custody certification ensures that certified products maintain their integrity and traceability as they move through the supply chainâ€”from farm to packing, distribution, and consumer.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">GLOBALGAP<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">C.O.C. Certification</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">GLOBALGAP Chain of Custody (C.O.C.) is a certification scheme designed for supply chain operatorsâ€”packers, traders, distributors, and retailersâ€”who handle GLOBALGAP-certified products. It verifies that certified products retain their identity and certification status at every stage of handling, ensuring complete traceability and product integrity from farm to consumer.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is GLOBALGAP C.O.C.?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">GLOBALGAP Chain of Custody (C.O.C.) is a certification scheme that ensures the integrity of certified products as they move through the supply chain. It provides documented traceability from farm to consumer, verifies segregation of certified and non-certified products, and ensures that certified products maintain their identity through handling, packing, storage, and distribution. C.O.C. certification is essential for supply chain operators who wish to make GLOBALGAP claims on their products.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367686/eurocert/F8.png.png" class="w-full h-full transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 object-cover" alt="GLOBALGAP"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Our C.O.C.<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-link text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">C.O.C. Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full certification services for supply chain operators ensuring that GLOBALGAP-certified products maintain their certified status throughout the chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-route text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Supply Chain Traceability</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive verification of traceability systems ensuring products can be tracked from farm to consumer at every stage of the supply chain.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Product Integrity</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Verification that certified products maintain their identity and certification status as they move through handling, packing, and distribution.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sitemap text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Chain Management</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Assessment and optimization of your chain of custody management systems including segregation, labeling, and documentation controls.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert support for documentation systems, record-keeping, and compliance paperwork required for C.O.C. certification.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Compliance Monitoring</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous monitoring and support to maintain your GLOBALGAP C.O.C. certification and adapt to evolving traceability requirements.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of <span class="text-euro-600">C.O.C. Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-route text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Traceability</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensure complete product traceability through the supply chain from farm to consumer.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-check-double text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Product Integrity</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Maintain product identity and certification status at every stage of distribution.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-heart text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Consumer Trust</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Build consumer confidence in certified products with transparent chain of custody.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-store text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Market Access</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meet requirements of buyers and retailers requiring verified traceability systems.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-eye text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Supply Chain Transparency</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demonstrate full transparency and accountability across your supply chain operations.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose Eurocert for <span class="text-eurogold-400">GLOBALGAP<!-- -->?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Expert Certification</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our experienced auditors understand GLOBALGAP C.O.C. requirements and the complexities of supply chain traceability. We provide thorough assessments of your chain of custody systems, clear guidance on segregation and documentation, and practical support to help you achieve and maintain certification.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-globe-asia text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Why Eurocert Asia?</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Eurocert Asia offers comprehensive GLOBALGAP C.O.C. certification services with deep expertise in supply chain operations. We work collaboratively with packers, traders, and distributors to ensure effective chain of custody management and long-term compliance.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6"><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">49</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Countries</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">25+</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Years Experience</span></div><div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-eurogold-400/20 bg-eurogold-400/5 text-center"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-3xl block mb-1 leading-none">100%</span><span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-white/50 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Success Rate</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="bg-[#f8fafc] py-10 lg:py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"></div></div><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/globalgap/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367659/eurocert/F2.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">GLOBALGAP</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Farm Assurance</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/globalgap-grasp/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367691/eurocert/F9.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">GLOBALGAP GRASP</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.2em] heading-font">Social Practices</span></div></a><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/food-certification/globalgap-spring/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367682/eurocert/F7.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/80 via-[#030a16]/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 z-20"><h4 class="text-white text-sm heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">GLOBALGAP SPRING</h4><span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase text-eurogold-400 tracking-